WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Upbeat music]
Big-screen plans? Find films around Yokohama with your little Hama Movie! buddy.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose a date and search by film or cinema. Narrow the list by area or select Upcoming.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Tap a film title. Explore its showtimes across cinemas for the coming week!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Tap Book beside a screening to open the cinema's official site. Check the latest times and availability there.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Tap the star to save a film. Open the … menu for Watched, Not interested, or View film showtimes.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Tap Add to plans, then find it under My screenings in the sidebar. Tickets must be booked separately.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Shared shows all registered members' upcoming plans and watchlists. Your saved plans and watchlist are shared automatically.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Use JP / EN in the top bar to switch languages. Your choice is saved to your account. Find your next film!
